# Story page: stats
# {name} becomes the snake's name. Paragraphs are separated by a blank line.
title = The Ledger
---
Somewhere, by the light of a stub of candle, a beetle writes down everything {name} does: every apple eaten, every rock bumped, every tail bitten in a moment of haste.

Nobody has ever thanked the beetle. The beetle does not expect to be thanked. The beetle has, I notice, written that down as well, in a very small and wounded hand.
